  "notes": "Learners say prima elementare, terza media, quinta superiore. Upper secondary (licei, istituti tecnici, istituti professionali) lasts five years, ending with the esame di Stato (maturità) in the quinta; some schools run experimental four-year courses. Regional vocational courses (IeFP, three or four years) are an alternative after the terza media."
